<back><div type="verses">
<lg label="2."><l>Holy, Holy, Holy! all the saints adore Thee;</l><l>Heaven’s elders cast their crowns down by the glassy sea;</l><l>Cherubim and seraphim worship too before Thee,</l><l>Who wert, and art, and evermore shalt be.</l></lg>
<lg label="3."><l>Holy, Holy, Holy! though the darkness hide Thee,</l><l>Though the eye of sinful man Thy glory may not see,</l><l>Only Thou art holy, there is none beside Thee</l><l>Perfect in power, in love, and purity.</l></lg>
</div>
</back>
</music></mei>
